Package: conky-spotify-nowplaying
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: mfagerstrom <48690419+mfagerstrom@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: conky-all, playerctl, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-pango-1.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, libx11-6, x11-utils, x11-xserver-utils, xdg-utils, libnotify-bin, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, fonts-ubuntu, fonts-dejavu-core
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mfagerstrom/conky-spotify-nowplaying
Description: Spotify now-playing desktop widget (Conky)
 Shows the current Spotify track with album art, previous/play-pause/next
 controls, a draggable seek bar, a like button and smoothly scrolling synced
 lyrics from LRCLIB. The background takes its colour from the album art.
 Built for GNOME on Wayland (runs through XWayland).
